    "reason": "OMN-20685 hand-flips node_git_effect to canonical def-B by binding the admission_check operation to HandlerGitAdmissionTransport, a pure adapter over HandlerGitAdmission.handle(request). Every admission decision function of handler_git_admission (69 symbols) is preserved verbatim from the relocated module of omniclaude#2595 and re-derived from git by the ratchet's hand-flip check, so the flip moves only the envelope boundary. The 53.16 percent is branch coverage (303 of 570) by the two declared parity tests alone, over the 36-case corpus recorded from the pre-relocation guard at c13a44482 (registry, clean and dirty restore, lane fetch, raw payload). The guard's own suites (test_shared_tree_git_guard, test_dirty_path_restore_guard, test_git_fetch_guard, test_guard_command_resolver, test_git_admission_runtime, with the parity tests) reach 476 of 570 branches, 83.51 percent, on the same module.",
